[00:00.00] 作词 : Renko
[00:01.00] 作曲 : ZUN
[00:02.00] 编曲 : Maurits"禅"Cornelis
[00:03.37]编曲：Maurits"禅"Cornelis
[00:30.37]Nobody's gonna stop me now.
[00:30.37]现今已无人可以阻止吾辈
[00:35.45]I'm ready to be who I am.
[00:35.45]准备好做自己 矢志不移
[00:41.07]There's no need to understand.
[00:41.07]没必要让他人理解
[00:44.59]
[00:45.22]I've been caught and it doesn't matter if someone
[00:45.22]也曾陷入困境 即使有人注意到
[00:52.28]Finds out. Who cares?
[00:52.28]也无济于事 又有谁在意我？
[00:55.91]This is just for you and me.
[00:55.91]世间只剩彼此你我
[00:59.38]
[01:00.25]Falling in love, reaching for you.
[01:00.25]坠入爱河 渴望伴你左右
[01:03.40]A miracle.
[01:03.40]宛如奇迹
[01:07.60]What does it mean to feel this way?
[01:07.60]这种心动 究竟是何意？
[01:10.87]I just can't hide...
[01:10.87]只是再难压抑这份情意…
[01:13.76]
[01:14.55]Been searching for this all my life.
[01:14.55]此生一直在寻找的
[01:18.31]It's how you make me feel inside, oh.
[01:18.31]恰是你给我的心动
[01:22.06]I'm burning up with just a gaze.
[01:22.06]仅是注视 已让我心如火焚
[01:25.74]No slowing down now, I'm going crazy.
[01:25.74]已无法冷静 快要失去理智
[01:29.31]
[01:29.59]So let me stay here for a while.
[01:29.59]所以 让我多依偎你一刻
[01:33.22]Since I've been dyed in all your colors,
[01:33.22]只因我已染上你的颜色
[01:37.00]There's a mark you have left on me, unseen.
[01:37.00]你留下的印记 难以看见
[01:42.53]It just can't fade away.
[01:42.53]但永不褪却
[01:45.02]
[02:00.30]Though I know, can't believe how long it's been since this
[02:00.30]难以置信自从离别已是如此之久 明明很清楚
[02:07.39]Began. Just breathe.
[02:07.39]深呼吸吧
[02:10.98]Don't conform, just let it out.
[02:10.98]切莫逆来顺受 只需顺其自然
[02:14.84]
[02:15.30]Even if they seem to think it's
[02:15.30]即使世人觉得一切都是
[02:18.55]Impossible,
[02:18.55]天方夜谭
[02:22.57]If it's all right, let me hold you
[02:22.57]倘若一切安好 让我拥你入怀吧
[02:25.92]Just one more time.
[02:25.92]多一次就好
[02:29.39]
[02:29.72]I just can't hide what I have felt.
[02:29.72]只是无法压抑这份情意
[02:33.35]I'm drowning deep within emotions.
[02:33.35]在浓情蜜意中无法自拔
[02:36.98]I can't resist this pull inside.
[02:36.98]难以抵挡内心的悸动
[02:40.71]Letting it all go takes so much courage.
[02:40.71]放下所有爱恋需要太多勇气
[02:44.38]
[02:44.60]So many times, my heart has called,
[02:44.60]屡次三番 我的心在呼唤
[02:48.09]No matter where you are, I'm waiting.
[02:48.09]就算你在天涯海角 我依然等你
[02:51.96]So tonight, I'll stay here with you, by your side...
[02:51.96]所以今晚 我会一直在你身边…
[02:57.61]
[02:59.57]Been searching for this all my life.
[02:59.57]此生一直在寻找的
[03:03.32]It's how you make me feel inside, oh.
[03:03.32]恰是你给我的心动
[03:07.03]I'm burning up with just a gaze.
[03:07.03]仅是注视 已让我心如火焚
[03:10.75]No slowing down now, I'm going crazy.
[03:10.75]已无法冷静 快要失去理智
[03:14.17]
[03:14.53]So let me touch you for a while.
[03:14.53]所以 让我多爱抚你一刻
[03:18.25]This fever's setting me on fire.
[03:18.25]激情让我欲火焚身
[03:22.00]Only if you hold me closer tonight,
[03:22.00]只有当你今晚抱紧我
